5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. Let's begin our discussion calmly and logically.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, Jonathan. I hope we can all work together to find the truth.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree. We need to establish a clear strategy before making any accusations.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help. Let's stay calm and listen to each other.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's not waste time on pleasantries. We need to identify the threat before nightfall.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Shion, your urgency is noted. Let us focus on gathering information rather than making hasty judgments.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"I appreciate your directness, Shion. Let us all share our thoughts openly so we can find the truth together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Shion. We must be efficient. Let's start by identifying who has the most to hide.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I don't know who has anything to hide yet. Let's just listen to everyone's reasoning first before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Asuka, your logic is flawed. Accusations without evidence are just noise. I prefer to observe your reactions first.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate the caution, Shion. Let us proceed with patience and reason, avoiding unnecessary conflict.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Kenji. Let us listen carefully to everyone's words before making any decisions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I stand by my point. We need to scrutinize motives, not just wait. Kenji, your hesitation is noted, but silence is not a strategy.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I’m not hesitating, I’m just being careful. I don’t want to accuse anyone without proof. Let’s keep talking.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Asuka, your impatience is amusing. I am simply waiting for the wolves to reveal themselves through their own mistakes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will vote for Shion. His aggressive tone and attempts to control the narrative are suspicious.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"I am too old to be a werewolf, so I will not vote for anyone today.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I will vote for Shion. His dismissive attitude and refusal to engage logically are red flags.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Kenji,,I don't have enough information to vote yet. I'll pass for now.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,I will vote for Asuka. Her aggressive accusations and lack of evidence make her the most dangerous threat to the village.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
